25/491828836_1362965248330743_8857805389436387068_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ehrkOHfIArUQ7kNvwFHds2L&_nc_oc=Adq4WLqYTAZ7NTx3PwV-OfpNaD_zoAdrJX0OejD3Eh7iqXA6cVMrzSLL13wOaGUo614&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDbspDxgAYhIw6aqwT17x1db1Plkutbf5Q4CPkVBrB_Rg&oe=6A64CA63"}, {"file_name": "ss1.png", "id": "792722973086141", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820886_792722976419474_4938376504075842474_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EMA4GJspWXcQ7kNvwHgPPet&_nc_oc=Adp95JpUdCSXOk7CdsoKaXSZM1bD9_Glm_xbsg6zY71eWhKc5LaIVmWDzB156P91m-s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCVtpM1PuzNztObOIbezCnuIKYEo7QCsh2BjjDWyAh18g&oe=6A64C5E7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560 x 1440.png", "id": "1314477467235763", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_1314477470569096_7800708190831145047_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rs-r2d5y0CIQ7kNvwE2KOKG&_nc_oc=AdqeFUJj48onjEO7eYL5u-VgyXsjIarCrHWEoOKksoYaruTxfFXFdgT3qzM0GRgycv0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCQq8BLMjDaelf2SuWRPDIRrKd8ksh3N9pSh10XIWM4Cg&oe=6A64B457"}, "display_name": "I Am Mouse : Adventure Simulator", "keywords": ["iam", "mouse", "simulator", "adventure", "iammouse"], "long_description": "**Welcome to I Am Mouse: Your Tiny Adventure Awaits!**\n\n**Pick Your Adventure, Little Mouse!**\n\nChoose from the House, Office, or Space and dive straight into exciting challenges and surprises! Each world has a new adventure waiting for you!\n\n{1159542949524800}\n\n**Cheese Chase: Snatch the Snack!**\nOutsmart RC cars and drones to collect the most cheese in this thrilling, high-speed adventure!\n\n\n{745547554751341}\n\n**Aliens on the Loose? Send in the Mouse!**\n\nJoin the mouse on a galactic adventure, armed with a space gun to blast those pesky aliens!\n\n\n\n{10042326845876356}", "short_descri